msgid "The model of the Whisper API identifies the speakers."
msgstr "Modellen i Whisper-API:et identifierar talarna."

#: src/views/settings/cards/options_card.py:141
msgid ""
"Only available with WhisperX, or with the gpt-4o-transcribe-diarize model"
